# RONDB-1062: scan vs key-op deadlock discovery (lock takeover).
# A locking range scan (FOR UPDATE takes its row locks over to commit on
# a buddy key-op connection) deadlocked with a key operation must be
# resolved proactively - exactly one transaction aborted (the victim is
# the smaller transaction-id hash, either side), promptly, with
# TransactionDeadlockDetectionTimeout set to 60s (see .cnf).
# ndb_deadlock_scan: scan vs key-op (takeover) deadlock resolved
# proactively - exactly one transaction aborted.
